Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] di_multi: match ddbg_sw prototype

GCC 13 reports enum/integer mismatches as errors when the tree builds with
Werror. Keep the implementation signature aligned with the existing header
prototype.

---
 common_drivers/drivers/media/di_multi/di_dbg.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/common_drivers/drivers/media/di_multi/di_dbg.c b/common_drivers/drivers/media/di_multi/di_dbg.c
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/common_drivers/drivers/media/di_multi/di_dbg.c
+++ b/common_drivers/drivers/media/di_multi/di_dbg.c
@@ -618,7 +618,7 @@ void ddbg_sw(bool on)
 }
 #else
 
-void ddbg_sw(enum EDI_LOG_TYPE mode, bool on)
+void ddbg_sw(unsigned int mode, bool on)
 {
 	struct di_dbg_reg_log *plog = get_dbg_reg_log();
 
